              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "zhǐyào mǎi yìbǎi kuài qián de dōngxi jiù kěyǐ chōujiǎng — Spend a hundred yuan and you can enter the prize draw."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Its characters come later; for now it is a word for the ear."
            }
          ]
        },
